# Example manifest for prepull_images.sh: the acceptance images (Operator
# steps, step 2) by the digests their tags had on the reference host, as
# `docker image inspect --format '{{index .RepoDigests 0}}' IMAGE` prints
# them. A task naming an image by such a digest uses the cached image with
# no pull budget; the acceptance itself names the tags, which step 2 pulls.
# A SWE-bench set looks the same, one line per image (about 500 lines,
# docker.io/swebench/sweb.eval.x86_64.<instance>@sha256:<digest>).
